OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed ex in 'rage of
OL,4,Aanger' as she walked her dog jailed for
OL,5,A24 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this year, McKenna pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to wounding with intent, but in
OL,9,FJuly was found guilty of attempted
OL,10,Fmurder.
